<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Comverse started as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Comverse started as buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Prudential Securities has started coverage of Israel's Comverse Technology Inc with a rating of buy, a source at the firm said on Monday.</p>
<p>-- Shares in Comverse, a maker and marketer of computer and telecommunications systems, closed on Friday at 39-3/4.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
